message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository and the associated manuscript."
type: software
title: "HC31: MATLAB analysis code for hippocampal beta2 events during exploration of an expanding environment"

authors:
  - family-names: "Lawand"
    given-names: "Angelo"

repository-code: "https://github.com/angelolawand05/HC31"
url: "https://github.com/angelolawand05/HC31"

license: MIT

abstract: >-
  Curated MATLAB analysis code and provenance documentation for a secondary
  analysis of the CRCNS hc-31 dorsal CA1 dataset examining temporal changes
  in hippocampal beta2 events during exploration of a progressively expanding
  environment.

keywords:
  - hippocampus
  - CA1
  - beta2
  - beta oscillations
  - electrophysiology
  - CRCNS
  - MATLAB
  - reproducibility
